# Once calculator.mynger.com is added as a custom domain in Netlify and its DNS has propagated,
# send anyone still on the old *.netlify.app URL (old bookmarks, old links) to the new domain.
# Scoped to the old host specifically — not a bare "/*" — so this can't ever redirect the new
# domain to itself.
https://mydeepcalculator.netlify.app/*  https://calculator.mynger.com/:splat  301!
